# 7. Project Documentation Phase
**Project Name:** ComicVerse AI

## Project Overview
ComicVerse AI is an end-to-end web application that converts text prompts into fully illustrated, multi-panel comic stories with exportable PDF documents[span_0](start_span)[span_0](end_span). Built using FastAPI, it combines Google Gemini models (Gemini Flash and Gemini Pro) for story structure and dialogue with Stable Diffusion (via Hugging Face Diffusers) for panel image generation[span_1](start_span)[span_1](end_span).

